  body { font: -apple-system-body, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; }
  h3 { font-size: 13px; margin: 14px 0 6px; }
  h3:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
  ul { margin: 6px 0; padding-left: 20px; }
  li { margin-bottom: 5px; }
  p { margin: 6px 0; }
</style>
<p>The first release MacBreeze can install by itself. If you are on 1.0.3, you should be offered this one rather than having to fetch it.</p>
<h3>Changed</h3>
<ul>
<li>Scrollbars no longer appear anywhere in the app.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Under the hood</h3>
<ul>
<li>Fixes to the release process: the download link on the site is now served by the site itself, and the published download is checked automatically after every release.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
